WEBVTT

02:00.000 --> 02:00.960
Use this.

02:02.440 --> 02:03.560
I checked.

02:03.640 --> 02:05.280
After you clean it with this,
no one will notice.

02:07.360 --> 02:09.360
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

02:53.440 --> 02:54.280
Sister,

02:56.920 --> 02:58.160
these three days…

02:58.240 --> 02:59.880
SATURDAY JUNE 28, SUNDAY JUNE 29

02:59.960 --> 03:01.880
…I'll act like nothing happened.

03:01.960 --> 03:02.880
MONDAY JUNE 30

03:02.960 --> 03:07.120
I'll make everyone believe
Xu Zhihong is still alive.

03:12.920 --> 03:16.160
After three days,
I'll stage a disappearance.

03:17.720 --> 03:18.920
But I need your help.

03:19.000 --> 03:21.520
Disappearance?

03:22.640 --> 03:24.240
You know about

03:24.320 --> 03:27.400
the cursed building rumor
of Yuanlongli, right?

03:28.960 --> 03:30.560
I want to use that rumor

03:31.760 --> 03:33.400
to make everyone believe

03:34.400 --> 03:37.280
that Xu Zhihong and I

03:38.000 --> 03:40.200
were both taken by that building.

03:41.080 --> 03:42.560
Why do it this way?

03:44.400 --> 03:46.480
Why not just leave quietly?
Wouldn't that be easier?

03:49.920 --> 03:51.080
It's not that simple.

03:51.680 --> 03:53.360
I borrowed from loan sharks.

03:53.440 --> 03:56.560
And Song Qingsong
from the cement factory was watching me.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.280
He made it clear

04:00.720 --> 04:02.400
he wants me gone from Weiyang.

04:02.480 --> 04:04.040
But that works out too.

04:05.720 --> 04:09.840
Even if the police find out
we disappeared on purpose,

04:10.480 --> 04:13.720
we can still shift the blame
onto Song Qingsong.

04:15.480 --> 04:17.920
At least they won't suspect
Xu Zhihong's death.

04:19.440 --> 04:21.880
But… But…

04:21.959 --> 04:24.120
If you leave, what am I supposed to do?

04:25.920 --> 04:28.680
Sister, stay here for now.

04:29.840 --> 04:33.000
If Xu Zhihong and I disappear
and then you leave too,

04:33.080 --> 04:35.040
the police will definitely suspect you.

04:35.880 --> 04:38.800
Besides, no one knows
that we even know each other.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.800
How long do I stay?

04:44.560 --> 04:45.680
This place…

04:46.400 --> 04:48.200
I… I can't live here anymore.

04:54.680 --> 04:57.760
Sister, hold on
until Yao Xincheng returns.

04:58.520 --> 05:01.480
He'll sell the house
and give you the money.

05:01.560 --> 05:03.800
Otherwise, all the hardship
will be for nothing.

05:11.960 --> 05:14.640
Then… what about you?

05:15.880 --> 05:17.200
Where will you go?

05:18.760 --> 05:19.600
I…

05:20.720 --> 05:22.160
I'll find a place

05:23.640 --> 05:26.640
where nobody knows who we are

05:28.400 --> 05:30.000
and build a safe home.

05:31.120 --> 05:32.560
I'll wait for you there.

05:33.600 --> 05:34.560
Sister,

05:38.480 --> 05:40.480
no one can give us safety.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.200
We can only rely on ourselves.

05:54.120 --> 05:55.040
Don't be scared.

05:58.560 --> 06:00.640
JUNE 30, 26TH DAY OF THE MONTH, MONDAY

07:28.240 --> 07:30.960
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

08:36.159 --> 08:39.000
Xu Zhihong's body
was disposed of in stages.

08:39.080 --> 08:41.520
Xu Meng kept the head and hands for last.

08:42.120 --> 08:43.840
When I impersonated Xu Zhihong,

08:43.919 --> 08:46.120
I needed his hand
to press the elevator buttons

08:46.200 --> 08:47.440
and leave fingerprints.

08:48.480 --> 08:49.920
After it was done,

08:50.000 --> 08:51.960
I got a tool bag and packed them inside.

08:52.880 --> 08:54.240
Xu Meng disposed of them.

09:05.880 --> 09:08.960
Xu Meng finally left
through the underground garage.

09:09.040 --> 09:10.800
That's the whole process.

09:12.240 --> 09:15.000
The elevator door and the garage key,

09:15.520 --> 09:16.800
where did they come from?

09:17.320 --> 09:19.400
The elevator key is universal.

09:20.080 --> 09:21.600
You can buy it at a hardware store.

09:22.440 --> 09:25.240
As for the garage key,
Xu Meng already had one.

09:25.320 --> 09:27.160
She used to work at Pattia

09:28.000 --> 09:29.720
and always used the underground access.

09:31.560 --> 09:33.400
That's quite thorough planning.

09:34.200 --> 09:36.520
We thought the plan was solid too.

09:37.400 --> 09:39.280
But something still went wrong.

10:10.160 --> 10:13.160
Come on. Why are you hiding?

11:08.720 --> 11:10.720
-Hello?
-It's me.

11:23.480 --> 11:25.840
I was spotted by Song Qingsong's driver.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.520
I'm locked up.

11:28.040 --> 11:29.280
Did he do anything to you?

11:29.360 --> 11:30.480
Don't worry.

11:31.440 --> 11:32.840
He can't do anything.

11:33.600 --> 11:35.440
He's just a sick pervert.

11:36.520 --> 11:38.160
I've figured out how to deal with him.

11:40.000 --> 11:42.520
By the way, that tool bag…

11:43.280 --> 11:44.320
What about it?

11:46.080 --> 11:47.120
It's nothing.

11:48.240 --> 11:49.160
I already burned it.

11:52.280 --> 11:54.400
I'm doing what you said,

11:54.480 --> 11:55.800
writing the rhyme on flyers.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.160
I'll hand them out tomorrow.

11:58.240 --> 12:01.200
Don't wait till tomorrow. Go now.

12:02.160 --> 12:04.720
Everyone's watching
the comeback livestream.

12:05.440 --> 12:07.120
The streets will be empty.

12:07.960 --> 12:10.760
Also, that dress you gave me,
the Bowls one,

12:10.840 --> 12:12.360
I forgot to take it.

12:12.440 --> 12:14.800
It can be traced back
to Yao Xincheng's purchase record.

12:14.880 --> 12:17.520
-We need to erase it.
-Okay.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.680
The police were in Yuanlongli all day
investigating the disappearance.

12:20.760 --> 12:22.000
I'm worried the place

12:22.880 --> 12:25.120
where we buried it might not be safe.

12:26.200 --> 12:28.000
I'll find a way to get out tomorrow,

12:28.080 --> 12:30.920
dig it up, and burn it.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.600
Even if it's found,

12:32.680 --> 12:34.320
they won't identify the body.

12:34.920 --> 12:35.840
I'll go instead.

12:39.440 --> 12:40.880
Just keep yourself safe.

12:51.080 --> 12:52.200
The next day,

12:53.080 --> 12:55.000
I went to where the body was buried,

12:56.520 --> 12:57.880
dug it up,

12:57.960 --> 13:00.840
and burned it along with the blue heels.

13:00.920 --> 13:02.160
Then buried it again.

13:02.920 --> 13:04.840
I was covered in dirt,

13:05.440 --> 13:06.960
afraid the police might see me,

13:07.760 --> 13:10.040
so I bought a potted plant

13:10.880 --> 13:13.360
to make it look like
the dirt came from that.

13:15.600 --> 13:16.840
Turns out…

13:18.640 --> 13:19.600
Watch out.

13:35.000 --> 13:38.960
Maybe it's because
I've been on edge for too long…

13:43.280 --> 13:45.560
How about you come in and wash up?

13:48.480 --> 13:51.240
I kept worrying the police
would show up at my door.

13:52.560 --> 13:54.960
But when I saw Ran that time,

13:55.640 --> 13:56.840
I felt like

13:57.640 --> 13:59.800
the police weren't that scary after all.

14:00.920 --> 14:03.040
So I thought I'd let him
come in and take a look.

14:04.240 --> 14:05.280
Once he saw,

14:07.400 --> 14:10.000
maybe after that,
I wouldn't be so nervous anymore.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.560
This photo. What's going on?

14:31.120 --> 14:33.400
It was Wu Shanlong
who forced Xu Meng to take it.

14:51.000 --> 14:51.840
Get in.

14:52.480 --> 14:53.440
I'm not going.

14:56.240 --> 14:59.160
You think you've got
other options right now?

14:59.240 --> 15:01.880
I tell you to do something, you do it.

15:03.200 --> 15:06.800
Wu Shanlong, aren't you afraid
of keeping me around?

15:06.880 --> 15:10.920
One day, I might slip
and expose how you scammed

15:11.000 --> 15:12.960
-Song Qingsong.
-You…

15:14.960 --> 15:16.000
Try it.

15:16.080 --> 15:18.200
I'll kill you right now.

15:18.280 --> 15:19.640
Then go ahead.

15:19.720 --> 15:22.360
I already told my dad
everything about you.

15:22.440 --> 15:24.160
He's already left Weiyang.

15:24.240 --> 15:28.000
If I die, what do you think he'll do?

15:34.560 --> 15:37.080
Xu Meng couldn't reveal herself,

15:37.160 --> 15:39.840
so she kept moving around
doing under-the-table jobs.

15:40.600 --> 15:43.920
During that time,
we barely stayed in touch.

15:45.280 --> 15:47.440
Until the spring of 2002,

15:48.880 --> 15:50.400
she suddenly called me.

15:51.520 --> 15:53.120
Said she'd saved enough money

15:54.520 --> 15:57.000
and wanted to go back
to where we first met

16:00.480 --> 16:02.200
and build a small house.

16:03.360 --> 16:04.800
I was so excited.

16:04.880 --> 16:09.240
I immediately called Yao Xincheng
to ask when he'd be back.

16:10.200 --> 16:13.480
Yao Xincheng said he planned
to return by year's end.

16:14.680 --> 16:16.920
When that happens, he'll keep his promise,

16:17.000 --> 16:20.080
sell the house, and give me the money.

16:21.040 --> 16:22.480
Hearing that,

16:24.280 --> 16:28.600
we got so excited,
stayed on the phone all night long.

16:31.440 --> 16:35.760
Back then, it felt like hope

16:37.760 --> 16:39.880
was finally within reach.

16:51.560 --> 16:55.800
But not long after, something happened.

17:02.320 --> 17:04.760
Hi there. I'm from property management.

17:04.839 --> 17:06.560
I'm here to check the TV lines.

17:06.640 --> 17:09.680
Lately, people have been complaining
about poor signal.

17:11.319 --> 17:13.839
You… You're from property management?

17:14.440 --> 17:16.599
I just started last week.

17:19.880 --> 17:22.319
Hey, have we met before?

17:24.079 --> 17:24.920
Well…

17:36.440 --> 17:39.240
I'd seen Wu Shanlong before
at Qihuang Clinic,

17:40.520 --> 17:42.040
but he didn't recognize me.

17:47.960 --> 17:49.840
Alright, the lines are fine.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.880
I'll head to the next place.

17:55.640 --> 17:57.000
Thanks.

18:27.840 --> 18:29.360
I wanted to call the police,

18:30.400 --> 18:32.560
but I was afraid
if Wu Shanlong got arrested,

18:33.200 --> 18:35.280
he'd expose Xu Meng.

18:35.360 --> 18:37.080
So I held it in.

18:37.680 --> 18:41.600
I kept the windows shut
and the curtains closed every day.

18:47.400 --> 18:49.840
After finally getting
a few years of sunlight,

18:53.040 --> 18:54.280
I had to block it out again.

18:55.680 --> 18:59.520
So Wu Shanlong didn't know
your connection to Xu Meng

19:00.640 --> 19:01.920
and never threatened you?

19:05.520 --> 19:07.120
We approached him first.

19:09.800 --> 19:11.240
At that time,

19:11.320 --> 19:15.720
Xu Zhihong's head
was found on the rooftop.

19:15.800 --> 19:17.960
I was so scared,
I couldn't sleep for days.

19:30.760 --> 19:33.040
REWARD NOTICE: 8,000 YUAN FOR USEFUL LEADS

19:38.760 --> 19:39.680
Back then,

19:40.200 --> 19:42.680
Wu Shanlong ran into me in the garage.

19:43.760 --> 19:45.440
I had no choice.

19:45.520 --> 19:48.960
I had to hide the tool bag nearby.

19:50.560 --> 19:53.480
A few days later, when I went back for it,

19:57.680 --> 20:01.600
I realized it was gone.

20:04.680 --> 20:08.600
I didn't tell you
because I didn't want you to worry.

20:10.960 --> 20:12.080
Meng,

20:14.120 --> 20:15.360
run.

20:17.200 --> 20:18.920
The farther, the better.

20:25.520 --> 20:26.640
Sister,

20:28.120 --> 20:29.600
I've been running for years.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.720
I don't want to run anymore.

20:35.680 --> 20:36.720
What if…

20:39.800 --> 20:42.400
What if the police find us? What do we do?

20:48.440 --> 20:49.480
There's someone

20:52.720 --> 20:54.520
who can die in our place.

20:56.800 --> 20:59.240
Xu Meng dug up
Xu Zhihong's bone fragments.

20:59.800 --> 21:02.000
I made fake shoes.

21:03.640 --> 21:06.960
Then Xu Meng snuck into
Wu Shanlong's place

21:08.320 --> 21:10.320
and put the fragments in the drain

21:11.360 --> 21:13.720
and placed the fake shoes on the rack.

21:16.200 --> 21:20.120
The trap that killed Wu Shanlong…
Xu Meng taught me how to make it.

21:20.960 --> 21:25.120
That day, she was even ready
to do it herself.

21:25.200 --> 21:28.320
The day Wu Shanlong was arrested,
Xu Meng was there too?

21:45.440 --> 21:46.280
He!

21:47.120 --> 21:49.000
He! Hey, He, don't fall asleep!

21:49.640 --> 21:50.680
He!

21:56.480 --> 21:59.920
After Wu Shanlong died,
Xu Meng left Weiyang.

22:01.800 --> 22:03.520
In the winter of 2002,

22:04.520 --> 22:07.080
Yao Xincheng asked me to sell the house.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.320
I got the money,

22:10.720 --> 22:12.480
but I didn't tell Xu Meng.

22:13.680 --> 22:14.920
Why?

22:20.120 --> 22:21.640
Because at that time,

22:23.040 --> 22:24.320
I realized…

22:35.720 --> 22:37.880
I had fallen for Ran.

22:51.560 --> 22:53.360
I knew it was dangerous,

22:55.000 --> 22:57.840
but I still wanted to be with him.

23:02.160 --> 23:04.120
When I was with him,

23:06.880 --> 23:08.640
I felt safe.

23:20.640 --> 23:22.880
Back then, after Uncle Ran found you,

23:24.400 --> 23:25.720
did he come to you?

23:31.680 --> 23:33.400
SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE WAS WRONG

23:37.080 --> 23:38.840
SIR, THE JUNE 30TH CASE
WAS WRONG, ALL WRONG

23:38.920 --> 23:40.720
SEND

23:44.640 --> 23:45.920
QIAO

23:59.040 --> 23:59.880
Ran.

24:01.240 --> 24:03.000
What's wrong? Why rush over?

24:09.040 --> 24:10.000
Do I look good?

24:20.880 --> 24:22.720
Let's go somewhere quiet.

24:27.400 --> 24:28.360
Sure.

24:41.560 --> 24:42.480
What's wrong?

24:43.080 --> 24:44.680
Why are you so distracted?

24:49.440 --> 24:52.200
Is something wrong at work?

24:56.400 --> 24:59.040
Is it… a tough case?

25:01.320 --> 25:02.160
Qiao.

25:05.560 --> 25:07.520
Do you remember when we first met?

25:09.440 --> 25:10.600
Of course I do.

25:11.720 --> 25:12.840
Back then…

25:12.920 --> 25:14.400
Back then, I was investigating
on the 18th floor.

25:16.400 --> 25:17.920
You were covered in dirt,

25:18.720 --> 25:21.640
holding a pot of orchids,
walking into the building.

25:24.280 --> 25:25.600
You're such a neat person.

25:26.520 --> 25:28.960
Why would you press
the pot against your clothes

25:29.600 --> 25:31.160
and get dirt all over yourself?

25:34.920 --> 25:38.440
Because you already
had dirt on you, right?

25:41.320 --> 25:42.320
Ran,

25:43.800 --> 25:45.720
why would you say that?

25:47.960 --> 25:49.120
You were dumping a body, weren't you?

25:52.800 --> 25:54.800
Ran, don't scare me.

25:55.640 --> 25:58.040
What… What body?

25:58.120 --> 25:59.600
That sounds scary.

26:02.600 --> 26:04.640
It was Xu Meng and her father.

26:05.720 --> 26:08.320
Xu Meng and her father?
What does that have to do with me?

26:09.280 --> 26:11.680
-Weren't they killed by Wu Shanlong?
-Qiao,

26:14.360 --> 26:15.680
stop lying.

26:17.160 --> 26:20.000
Yao Xincheng, the Bowls dress,

26:20.080 --> 26:21.400
the red heels turned blue,

26:22.080 --> 26:26.360
and what happened in restroom 415,
I've figured it all out.

26:31.360 --> 26:32.480
All these years,

26:33.600 --> 26:36.560
how could you act
like nothing happened when facing me

26:38.400 --> 26:39.440
and facing Sir?

26:40.960 --> 26:44.360
You hid it so well, for so long.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.440
I… I didn't…

26:51.320 --> 26:54.000
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

26:56.440 --> 26:57.920
I didn't.

27:03.000 --> 27:04.240
All these years,

27:07.840 --> 27:10.760
I just wanted to crawl
out of the darkness.

27:11.760 --> 27:14.600
I just wanted to feel the sun again.

27:16.040 --> 27:18.240
Why is it so hard?

27:22.320 --> 27:25.520
Ran, tell me.

27:26.800 --> 27:29.040
Why is it so hard?

27:41.160 --> 27:42.280
Qiao,

27:43.880 --> 27:45.000
turn yourself in.

28:25.120 --> 28:28.720
Tomorrow morning, I'll turn myself in.

28:31.080 --> 28:32.080
I'll go with you.

28:37.080 --> 28:39.040
But tonight,

28:40.040 --> 28:41.520
can I stay with you,

28:42.600 --> 28:46.160
with Officer He and Xiaohe,

28:49.880 --> 28:54.880
like a family and have a reunion dinner?

28:56.280 --> 28:58.960
This is my New Year's wish.

28:59.800 --> 29:04.680
It's also been my only wish
all these years.

29:20.480 --> 29:21.480
Eight p.m.

29:22.760 --> 29:23.720
I'll pick you up.

29:25.680 --> 29:26.960
We'll go to Sir's place together.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.880
I'm sorry.

29:49.960 --> 29:51.760
I failed Ran.

29:55.480 --> 29:57.480
If he hadn't come to get me,

30:00.760 --> 30:03.000
he wouldn't have been killed by Xu Meng.

30:10.160 --> 30:11.880
I failed him.

30:20.400 --> 30:21.280
Qiao Suqing,

30:22.040 --> 30:24.280
why do you say it was Xu Meng
who killed Captain Ran?

30:25.080 --> 30:26.200
That afternoon,

30:28.120 --> 30:29.320
I called her

30:30.520 --> 30:32.160
and told her Ran had figured me out.

30:34.400 --> 30:35.560
I told her everything.

30:36.520 --> 30:37.680
What did Xu Meng say?

30:40.160 --> 30:44.160
She said she'd turn herself in with me.

30:45.800 --> 30:46.880
And after that--

30:46.960 --> 30:48.560
So she lied to me!

30:49.560 --> 30:51.200
She lied to me!

30:52.720 --> 30:54.640
She said she was in Kunhai

30:56.520 --> 30:59.920
and would take the earliest train
to Weiyang the next day.

31:03.440 --> 31:04.720
The next morning,

31:06.560 --> 31:08.120
she came to my place.

31:13.200 --> 31:16.440
I even saw her with that day's ticket!

31:18.360 --> 31:20.080
She's a liar!

31:20.720 --> 31:22.000
A liar!

31:22.640 --> 31:25.480
By your account,
Xu Meng had no time to commit it.

31:30.920 --> 31:33.520
It was Xu Meng. She killed Ran.

31:36.280 --> 31:37.840
It had to be her.

31:51.400 --> 31:54.320
CAPTAIN QU
WE'VE GOT HER. INTERROGATION ROOM 2

32:01.640 --> 32:03.160
INTERROGATION ROOM 1

32:21.120 --> 32:26.200
INTERROGATION ROOM 2

32:36.680 --> 32:37.520
Xiaohe.

33:21.120 --> 33:24.000
Don't worry. I've got you.

34:12.159 --> 34:13.320
Xu Meng.

34:22.480 --> 34:24.159
You caught me,

34:25.159 --> 34:27.280
so you must've caught Qiao Suqing too.

34:28.800 --> 34:31.880
Officer, you've got it wrong.

34:33.320 --> 34:35.679
Everything… I did it.

34:37.280 --> 34:39.360
Qiao Suqing had nothing to do with it.

34:39.440 --> 34:43.120
Whether she was involved
is for us to decide.

34:44.120 --> 34:47.560
She's already confessed.
Now it's your turn.

34:48.159 --> 34:50.960
Xu Meng, you faked your death
for 18 years.

34:51.040 --> 34:54.120
We found you and brought you here.

34:54.199 --> 34:56.280
Stop thinking you'll get lucky.

34:56.360 --> 34:58.240
Don't try to protect anyone either.

34:58.320 --> 35:01.000
Tell the truth. It's your only way out.

35:05.240 --> 35:06.920
It's not that I won't talk.

35:07.520 --> 35:09.240
It's just, when I think about it,

35:11.240 --> 35:13.320
there's just too much I've done.

35:15.800 --> 35:18.160
I don't even know where to start.

35:18.240 --> 35:20.040
Then take it one by one.

35:20.120 --> 35:21.280
Start from the beginning!

35:22.560 --> 35:24.040
The first one…

35:24.640 --> 35:25.800
Yao.

35:26.680 --> 35:31.880
It should've been in 1996.

35:50.240 --> 35:51.520
Hello.

36:33.720 --> 36:34.560
Ghost!

36:50.680 --> 36:54.880
I originally just wanted
to teach Yao a lesson,

36:55.920 --> 36:59.600
make him crippled,
so he couldn't abuse Suqing.

37:00.840 --> 37:04.080
I didn't expect he'd actually die.

37:05.080 --> 37:09.400
I watched him stop moving.

37:12.080 --> 37:16.720
I wasn't scared at all.
I actually felt relieved.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.800
Suqing…

37:21.360 --> 37:22.760
She was finally free.

37:27.920 --> 37:29.280
Who else did you kill?

37:30.560 --> 37:31.680
Xu Zhihong.

37:33.200 --> 37:34.400
I pushed him.

37:35.960 --> 37:37.280
I watched him die too.

37:46.360 --> 37:47.880
Then I cut up his body

37:49.080 --> 37:50.440
and dumped it in the woods.

37:51.400 --> 37:53.080
Then,

37:55.680 --> 37:57.480
in the summer of 2002,

37:59.320 --> 38:01.520
in Yuanlongli's garage,

38:02.280 --> 38:07.320
I used the same method to set a trap

38:08.560 --> 38:10.960
and killed that sick Wu Shanlong.

38:11.040 --> 38:12.040
Xu Meng,

38:13.440 --> 38:16.640
what we've learned
doesn't match your statement.

38:17.480 --> 38:19.080
Think carefully before you answer.

38:22.120 --> 38:25.880
You mean that Qiao Suqing was involved?

38:29.160 --> 38:32.600
It's been too long.
I don't remember the details.

38:32.680 --> 38:35.560
Either way, I came up with the plans.

38:36.240 --> 38:39.080
I… was the mastermind.

38:39.160 --> 38:43.840
So, using grease at the scene
is your usual method?

38:45.480 --> 38:47.080
Not always.

38:49.080 --> 38:51.280
In winter 2002,

38:51.360 --> 38:53.800
I also set a fire
and burned a child to death.

38:55.480 --> 38:56.640
Be specific.

38:56.720 --> 38:59.480
Where did you set it? Who was the child?

39:00.640 --> 39:03.880
Just… a kid from Yuanlongli.

39:07.400 --> 39:09.040
Back in '97,

39:10.040 --> 39:12.440
he saw me in Yuanlongli.

39:12.520 --> 39:14.160
NEW YORK BLOCK

39:30.760 --> 39:33.200
I ran into him again in 2002.

39:33.280 --> 39:35.360
I thought he recognized me.

39:35.440 --> 39:37.120
He also knew that cop.

39:37.200 --> 39:41.120
Qiao Suqing and I couldn't risk anything.

39:45.960 --> 39:47.040
Fire! Fire!

39:47.120 --> 39:49.000
CAROUSEL'S DEAD HEAT

39:49.080 --> 39:50.360
Fire! Fire!

39:50.440 --> 39:52.520
-Call the police!
-Call the police!

39:52.600 --> 39:54.040
Put it out!

39:54.120 --> 39:55.200
Danger!

39:59.880 --> 40:02.960
POLICE

40:05.720 --> 40:07.400
You burned Keyboard to death.

40:12.040 --> 40:15.560
Officer, you knew that boy?

40:15.640 --> 40:17.440
Xu Meng, have you no conscience?

40:17.520 --> 40:19.480
Xiaohe! Xiaohe! Sit down.

40:20.720 --> 40:22.160
Sit down.

40:23.680 --> 40:24.720
Sit down.

40:30.680 --> 40:31.520
Go on.

40:32.760 --> 40:35.240
I didn't mean to kill the boy.

40:35.920 --> 40:38.400
It's just that when
I came back to Weiyang,

40:39.280 --> 40:41.240
I was so angry.

40:41.800 --> 40:44.600
RENTAL AGREEMENT

41:10.840 --> 41:13.560
Why are you here? You didn't even tell me.

41:14.480 --> 41:15.680
When is Yao coming back?

41:17.240 --> 41:20.360
Didn't I say end of the year?
What's wrong?

41:24.920 --> 41:27.520
Sister, our home is ready.

41:27.600 --> 41:29.200
Do you want to go see it with me?

41:31.360 --> 41:34.600
Meng, I… I can't go with you yet.

41:35.440 --> 41:37.640
I have… work. I still need my job.

41:39.320 --> 41:41.000
You must be thirsty.
I'll get you some water.

41:53.320 --> 41:54.800
You're moving?

41:55.640 --> 41:58.280
Didn't you say you'd stay till it's sold?

42:01.040 --> 42:03.160
Well, this place leaks,

42:03.240 --> 42:06.080
and since we're selling it,
I figured I'd move out first.

42:06.640 --> 42:09.720
Closer to work, save on commute.

42:10.680 --> 42:13.920
Then don't rent a place. Come with me.

42:14.000 --> 42:16.720
When Yao gets back, you can come back.

42:17.520 --> 42:20.040
You can find work anywhere, right?

42:23.680 --> 42:27.400
Meng, I think I should wait.

42:27.480 --> 42:30.960
Let's wait a bit longer. Okay?

42:34.120 --> 42:37.960
Sister, what are you waiting for?

42:38.040 --> 42:41.920
Is it this place,
something here you can't leave?

42:43.400 --> 42:44.520
Or is it…

42:46.600 --> 42:48.320
someone you can't let go of?

42:50.640 --> 42:52.080
How could that be?

42:53.040 --> 42:54.960
I just… I already paid three months' rent.

42:55.040 --> 42:57.480
Leaving now would be a waste.

42:58.680 --> 43:00.120
I'm going to the restroom.

43:47.760 --> 43:49.680
For the next few days,

43:50.360 --> 43:51.960
I didn't leave Weiyang.

43:52.560 --> 43:54.280
I just wanted to find out

43:55.480 --> 43:59.840
who the man in those slippers really was.
